# A rising ramp delays the emission and makes the field more symmetric; a falling one does the opposite.
# Reference: numerical integration on a finer grid in NumPy.
title Leakage ramped from 0 to 0.4 per um
grating angle=10 length=25
apodise linear from=0.0 to=0.4
expect radiated 0.99326205 1e-06
expect overlap 0.81500752 2e-05
expect efficiency 0.40475802 2e-05
expect position 8.91624967 0.005
